.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Integrates 1/sqrt(x) and log(x) over [0, 1], whose integrands blow up at 0. The tanh-sinh substitution crowds nodes toward the endpoints with double-exponentially small weights, and converges far faster than Gauss-Legendre quadrature on these integrands.">

